venture is available on its own, or can be combined with additional adventures on the same day. To customize your experience, the following adventure combinations are available.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#WHAT'S INCLUDED\nRound Trip van transportation from Waikiki, bike and helmet, water and snacks.. Waist pack, rain jacket and mosquito repellent also provided.\n \n**Note:** Gratuities are not included. Suggested gratuity: 10% of tour price.\n\n#WHAT TO BRING\nGuests are urged to bring your own water and snacks! Wear closed toe shoes and dress comfortable and bring a camera.\n\n##NOTE: \nRiders must be minimum 4'0\" tall to ride the bike. Tag-a-long trailer riders must be a minimum 3'5\" and able to demonstrate ability.", "cancellation_notes": "When booking this activity through a 3rd party, their cancellation policy applies. When booking direct, our cancellation policy is 24 hours before the tour. 50% within 24 hours and full charge for No Show.", "no_transportation_notes": "Please meet us at [Archie Baker Park](https://maps.app.goo.gl/hgz8eYy7kdvVcnqj7)", "no_transportation_minutes": 0, "headline": "All Ages  • Appx. 3 hours tour", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bikehawaii/items/556977/images/1229353/", "pk": 1229353, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/d5iM3tqRmW6kEjfs1s4Z", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/d5iM3tqRmW6kEjfs1s4Z", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bikehawaii/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bikehawaii/items/556977/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/d5iM3tqRmW6kEjfs1s4Z", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/d5iM3tqRmW6kEjfs1s4Z", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "I